# Tome of the Dead CONCEPT round-4 panel ornament (our motif: chain + winged skull) — DRAFT.
# Format = tools/gfx_convert.py --mode tile. Drawn ONCE into the storey-1 floor row (row 17), which
# doubles as the panel's top frame: floor attr (ATTR_FLOOR[depth]) so F9 holds (sprites never
# enter floor rows; heroes stand on its top line). Layout: cap_l, chain (link/bar alternating),
# wing_l skull_l skull_r wing_r at cols 14-17, chain, cap_r. 8 glyphs = 64 B (+8 attr), cold data.
